-- seated (2026-09-16, the room's word through the maintainer, ce851e7 in everyoneishere): a self-addressed word
-- leaves no remainder — the general rule, the draft one case of it, the invoice row unmoved, the reveal kept honest.
-- the assay's overheard now excludes a word whose audience is its author alone (`alone`); the concrete row regrows,
-- the wall reading regrows (a word only its author's seat hears is unread at every seat that does not hear the
-- author, by a_wall_hides_the_probe), and the general statement a_word_to_oneself_leaves_no_remainder stands as a
-- hand body: its proof walks the filter (mem_map_back, filter_holds, and_reads) and the shape keeping the audience,
-- a route the search does not compose. found 2026-09-15 by the rows: with piece 4 as first written, jordan's unsent
-- invoice narrated "jordan wrote to jordan" to the whole room.

